# Alfred output directory — free-form deliverables (summaries, exports,
# generated reports) Alfred writes for you. Untracked by convention: no
# version history, not indexed by `wiki search`. Durable knowledge belongs
# in the graph (wiki/) via `wiki write`, not here. See docs/CONVENTIONS.md.
output/

# Per-vault credentials and local runtime secrets. This directory is the
# supported place for the assistant env file, e.g. .alfred/private/env.
.alfred/private/
